  = must: preserve existing accepted schema files as boundary inputs unless a P2 completion review explicitly supersedes them

& [FinalWorkSlice: P2-S01-BoundaryImportAndSchemaGapReconciliation] is ready
  + [slice_id] is P2-S01
  + [slice_name] is boundary import and schema gap reconciliation
  + [chunk_ref] is P2 authority kernel and record schemas
  + [authority_basis] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_Post_IR8_Implementation_Readiness.canonical.sop
  + [activation_gate] is post-IR8 readiness accepted
  + [expected_output_set] is docs/schema/P2_Boundary_Import_And_Schema_Gap_Reconciliation.v1.sop
  + [verification_oracle] is boundary import lists accepted schema inputs, identifies schema refresh deltas, records natural-key and lifecycle matrix status, and classifies storage, fixture, packetization, adapter, dispatch, and live-control gates without mutating schemas
  + [model_route] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [model_route_reason] is schema gap reconciliation affects which accepted contracts remain authority and which need supersession
  + [forbidden_scope] is schema rewrite, storage implementation, fixture creation, dependency installation, package metadata mutation, adapter implementation, transport implementation, UI implementation, dispatch, operations control, and live machine control
  + [completion_review_required] is true

& [FinalWorkSlice: P2-S02-CommonEnvelopeAuthorityVocabularyAndFreshnessRefresh] is gated
  + [slice_id] is P2-S02
