  + [expected_output_set] is docs/schema/P2_Common_Envelope_Authority_Vocabulary_And_Freshness_Refresh.v1.sop
  + [verification_oracle] is refresh decision accepts, refines, or supersedes KernelRecord common fields, KernelRecordKind, AuthorityState, ReadinessState, RecordStatus, NaturalKeyState, FreshnessState, LineageEdgeKind, freshness rules, and lineage invariants while preserving source/projection separation
  + [model_route] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [model_route_reason] is common envelope and vocabulary changes affect all downstream schemas, operators, projections, and runtime records
  + [forbidden_scope] is record-specific schema rewrite beyond declared deltas, storage implementation, fixture creation, dependency installation, adapter implementation, dispatch, operations control, and live machine control
  + [completion_review_required] is true

