& [P2FinalSliceClosureReview] is the dependency audit for minted P2 final slices
  + [post_IR8_readiness_status] is accepted
  + [core_schema_status] is accepted_boundary_input
  + [record_schema_inventory_status] is accepted_boundary_input
  + [natural_key_matrix_status] is accepted_boundary_input
  + [IR2_extraction_mapping_status] is accepted_boundary_input
  + [current_ready_slice_set] is P2-S01
  + [unresolved_external_dependency_set] is empty_after_gate
  + [forbidden_external_dependency_found] is false
  + [dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [operations_control_authorized] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized] is false

  = must: treat P2-S02 through P2-S06 as gated, not ready
  = must: rerun closure review when a boundary pack changes, proof fails, or schema contradiction appears
